  "notes": [
    "Adds a Minion Calculator page with 59 minion definitions, tier/fuel/upgrade controls, LIVE and local 7-day pricing, NPC/Instant/Sell Order/Auto sale routes, setup cost, payback, ROI, stability and confidence.",
    "Adds a budget-and-slot setup optimizer that excludes unknown setup costs instead of guessing them.",
    "Super Compactor 3000 now uses discrete recursive compaction over the selected collection interval and preserves intermediate/raw leftovers.",
    "Corrects Fishing Minion current speeds/drop distribution and duplicate Minion Expander stacking.",
    "Inferno Minion is intentionally shown as unsupported until its special fuel/RNG/multi-minion model is implemented."
  ],
